<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone asked to change the password for your WISP account. You can choose a new one with the link below.</p>

<p><%= email_link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password won't change unless you use the link and set a new one.</p>
